{"id":"vod_sn_37165","vodId":"37165","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"你遭难了吗？","name_cn":"你遭难了吗？","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0cd09fbf1bbc1aff6e1388a905a71226.jpg"},"summary":"从小就在父亲身上学习到了很多生存技能的鬼岛誉（市道真央 配音）、同时参加了田径部和篮球部的超级运动系少女铃森明日香（河野日和 配音）、拥有高超的智商和好学生的外表，实际上却是一个超级腐女的天谷睦（安野希世乃 配音）、个性傲娇而又毒舌，但实际上非常想要得到大家的认可和喜欢的千金大小姐九条紫音（和气杏未 配音），一场空难中，这四名女子高中生成为了幸存者，并且漂流到了无人岛上。　　从来都是坐在课堂里学习书本知识的高中生们，该如何应对岛上极为恶劣和极端的情况呢？很快她们便会知道，想要在自然法则里生存下去，就要放弃很多东西。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/751zBBuv4p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XxzEcdrmbP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J5ceCdE3fT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pecShB83rf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6G5PS4FUmu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uQAxVr5Jn01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DjD3J8SzJf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/12iAyTqrW21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wD5yjaPcGf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hUi2df90vc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LvS0cZGWWX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tcgbn3FJw01/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:14.349Z"}